00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
The drag model D = ½ρCdAv² organizes density, coefficient, reference area and speed. Cd and area must use compatible conventions.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
With ρ=1.225 kg/m³, Cd=.32, A=2.2 m² and v=25 m/s, the illustrative fixed-input model gives about 270 N.

